    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Containers are designed with weather‑tight seals, ensuring that moisture does not seep in. Open trailers cannot provide the same level of dryness, leading to rust and corrosion.</p>
